1
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:08,840
Director!

2
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:10,260
Good work today.

3
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:12,050
Oh, good work.

4
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:18,560
And the Best Actor is...

5
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:21,270
Yamamoto Minato!!

6
00:00:21,270 --> 00:00:23,270
Yes!!

7
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:27,570
That kid actually did it!

8
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:32,620
Who would you like to share
this joy with?

9
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:37,120
To my mother in heaven,
and...

10
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:42,830
to the person who gave me
a place to belong on this stage.

11
00:01:01,350 --> 00:01:03,400
Minato...

12
00:01:05,320 --> 00:01:07,530
We still need to keep practicing.

13
00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:10,950
More practice, Haru senpai?

14
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:12,860
Welcome back.

15
00:01:12,860 --> 00:01:15,280
I'm back.

16
00:01:19,370 --> 00:01:22,250
(Thank you for watching. Stay tuned
for a message from Minato and Haru!)

17
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:24,670
To everyone who has supported
"The Viola in Your Heart"

18
00:01:24,670 --> 00:01:26,380
and watched us
until the very end,

19
00:01:26,380 --> 00:01:29,380
thank you so much.

20
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:32,010
Having you all with us
until the end

21
00:01:32,010 --> 00:01:34,050
has made us incredibly happy!

22
00:01:34,970 --> 00:01:36,720
The story has come to an end.

23
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:38,890
- I'm really going to miss it.
- Me too.

24
00:01:38,890 --> 00:01:40,270
But wait!

25
00:01:40,270 --> 00:01:41,270
We have some good news!

26
00:01:41,270 --> 00:01:42,350
Oh?

27
00:01:44,270 --> 00:01:46,610
"The Viola in Your Heart"

28
00:01:46,610 --> 00:01:47,980
after this,

29
00:01:47,980 --> 00:01:49,570
will have a special video
released online!

30
00:01:49,570 --> 00:01:52,030
- Oh!
- Wow!!

31
00:01:53,660 --> 00:01:55,870
It includes our interviews

32
00:01:55,870 --> 00:01:57,240
and tons of behind-the-scenes footage.

33
00:01:57,240 --> 00:02:00,250
It's packed with content, so

34
00:02:00,250 --> 00:02:02,620
make sure to watch it!!
